WEBVTT

00:07:28.944 --> 00:07:30.613
You know.

00:07:31.489 --> 00:07:34.825
That way, they have no prior associations,

00:07:34.825 --> 00:07:39.747
no memories to be comparing it to
of their mother's version of it.

00:07:39.788 --> 00:07:41.749
(Laughter)

00:07:41.749 --> 00:07:45.211
Maybe they have no opinions
about it at all.

00:07:45.252 --> 00:07:48.255
I'm going to spritz these
with a little sunflower oil.

00:07:48.881 --> 00:07:50.007
Ooh.

00:07:50.633 --> 00:07:51.800
Smokey.

00:07:54.261 --> 00:07:58.516
Now, seaweed and sea vegetables in general

00:07:58.557 --> 00:08:02.102
are a very exciting food space.